  "body": "### Describe the bug\n\nThe dark mode button doesn't work, the application is only in dark mode, and doesn\u00b4t change\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nInstall the version 1.61+ go to preferences and set other option apart from dark, mode, doesn't change it. If yyou set other settings by default, doesn\u00b4t work. Always use dark mode except if its a migrate user who has selected other mode in a previous version\n\n### Impact\n\nLow\n\n### Additional information\n\nTested with firefox, chrome and Edge, in multiple computers. Tested in versions 1.61, 1.74 and 1.76, doesn't work since 1.60\n\n### Version\n\n1.61.0\n\n### Installation method\n\nDocker Compose\n\n### Browser\n\nFirefox",
